StructElem>>endobj478 0 obj<</E(6.RIGHT OF APPEAL AGAINST AAC DECISIONS)/K[13]/P 130 0 R/Pg 25 0 R/S/H2/T(6.RIGHT OF APPEAL AGAINST AAC DECISIONS)/Type/StructElem>>endobj479 0 obj<</E(ASIC recognises that institutions that are refused Accreditation or have had their Accreditation withdrawn or suspended should have access to a fair and expeditious appeals process.  )/K[14]/P 130 0 R/Pg 25 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj480 0 obj<</E(Should the AAC refuse to award Accreditation or suspend/withdraw Accreditation, the Chair of the AAC will contact the institution to advise the principal/owner of the decision, detailing the reasons for their decision and reminding them of their Right of \Appeal. \(If the Appeal is by an accredited institution, its Accredited Status remains during the appeals process.\) The principal \(or another appropriate representative\) should then submit an appeal \(with the applicable Fee, see Finance Policy, Append\ix B\) within ten working days of receipt of the notification from the AAC. )/K[15]/P 130 0 R/Pg 25 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj481 0 obj<</E(Note that ASIC reserves the right to remove Accreditation without Appeal in specific cases, e.g. ASIC will withdraw the Right of Appeal if an institution is found guilty of deliberately providing false information.   )/K[16]/P 130 0 R/Pg 25 0 R/S/H3/T(Note that ASIC reserves the right to remove Accreditation without Appeal in specific cases, e.g. ASIC will withdraw the Right of Appeal if an institution is found guilty of deliberately providing false information.   )/Type/StructElem>>endobj493 0 obj<</A[1023 0 R 0]/K[28]/P 130 0 R/Pg 25 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj482 0 obj<</E(6.1. ASIC Appeals Procedure)/K[17]/P 130 0 R/Pg 25 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj483 0 obj<</E(6.1.2. Appeal to review the rejection of an application for Accreditation)/K[18]/P 130 0 R/Pg 25 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj484 0 obj<</E(If ASIC rejects an application after the Stage 2 Inspection, the institution can:)/K[19]/P 130 0 R/Pg 25 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj873 0 obj<</K[1668 0 R 1669 0 R]/P 130 0 R/Pg 25 0 R/S/L/Type/StructElem>>endobj487 0 obj<</E(The AAC will then hold the review and consider any new documentation and decide:)/K[22]/P 130 0 R/Pg 25 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj874 0 obj<</K[1670 0 R 1671 0 R]/P 130 0 R/Pg 25 0 R/S/L/Type/StructElem>>endobj1670 0 obj<</K[1019 0 R]/P 874 0 R/S/LI/Type/StructElem>>endobj1671 0 obj<</K[1020 0 R]/P 874 0 R/S/LI/Type/StructElem>>endobj1020 0 obj<</K 489 0 R/P 1671 0 R/S/LBody/Type/StructElem>>endobj489 0 obj<</E(To uphold the AAC's original decision: the institution has the Right of Appeal as described below.  )/K[24]/P 1020 0 R/Pg 25 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj1019 0 obj<</K 488 0 R/P 1670 0 R/S/LBody/Type/StructElem>>endobj488 0 obj<</E(In the institution's favour: the process will then proceed to Stage 3. )/K[23]/P 1019 0 R/Pg 25 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj1668 0 obj<</K[1017 0 R]/P 873 0 R/S/LI/Type/StructElem>>endobj1669 0 obj<</K[1018 0 R]/P 873 0 R/S/LI/Type/StructElem>>endobj1018 0 obj<</K 486 0 R/P 1669 0 R/S/LBody/Type/StructElem>>endobj486 0 obj<</E(Submit additional documentation responding to the reasons for rejection.)/K[21]/P 1018 0 R/Pg 25 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj1017 0 obj<</K 485 0 R/P 1668 0 R/S/LBody/Type/StructElem>>endobj485 0 obj<</E(Request a review of the inspection report)/K[20]/P 1017 0 R/Pg 25 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj1023 0 obj<</BBox[351.3299 -121.102394 691.63403 196.5625]/O/Layout/Placement/Block>>endobj1022 0 obj<</BBox[34.491558 399.69028 163.50134 400.44028]/O/Layout/Placement/Block>>endobj1663 0 obj<</K[1012 0 R]/P 872 0 R/S/LI/Type/StructElem>>endobj1664 0 obj<</K[1013 0 R]/P 872 0 R/S/LI/Type/StructElem>>endobj1665 0 obj<</K[1014 0 R]/P 872 0 R/S/LI/Type/StructElem>>endobj1666 0 obj<</K[1015 0 R]/P 872 0 R/S/LI/Type/StructElem>>endobj1667 0 obj<</K[1016 0 R]/P 872 0 R/S/LI/Type/StructElem>>endobj1016 0 obj<</K 474 0 R/P 1667 0 R/S/LBody/Type/StructElem>>endobj474 0 obj<</E(Refuses to pay any of its required ASIC Fees - on time and according to the Finance Policy \(Appendix B\) and any additional payment terms.)/K[9]/P 1016 0 R/Pg 25 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj1015 0 obj<</K 473 0 R/P 1666 0 R/S/LBody/Type/StructElem>>endobj473 0 obj<</E(Fails to disclose malpractice.)/K[8]/P 1015 0 R/Pg 25 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj1014 0 obj<</K 472 0 R/P 1665 0 R/S/LBody/Type/StructElem>>endobj472 0 obj<</E(Makes false claims/engages in misrepresentation in its publications \(including on its website\), particularly concerning professional memberships and accreditations.)/K[7]/P 1014 0 R/Pg 25 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj1013 0 obj<</K 471 0 R/P 1664 0 R/S/LBody/Type/StructElem>>endobj471 0 obj<</E(Fails to adhere to the Section 3 requirements of the ASIC Handbook.)/K[6]/P 1013 0 R/Pg 25 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj1012 0 obj<</K 470 0 R/P 1663 0 R/S/LBody/Type/StructElem>>endobj470 0 obj<</E(No longer meets the Accreditation criteria \(ASIC Standards of Accreditation\).)/K[5]/P 1012 0 R/Pg 25 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj1021 0 obj<</BBox[33.819206 783.2835 443.79688 784.0335]/O/Layout/Placement/Block>>endobj24 0 obj<</Annots[]/BleedBox[0.0 7.8299813 595.5 850.07996]/Contents 92 0 R/CropBox[0.0 7.8299813 595.5 850.07996]/MediaBox[0.0 7.8299813 595.5 850.07996]/Parent 2 0 R/Resources<</ExtGState 90 0 R/ProcSet[/PDF/Text/ImageB/ImageC/ImageI]/XObject<</X25 91 0 R>>>>/Rotate 0/StructParents 15/Tabs/S/TrimBox[0.0 7.8299813 595.5 850.07996]/Type/Page>>endobj92 0 obj<</Filter/FlateDecode/Length 200>>stream
