aints:)/Type/StructElem>>endobj453 0 obj<</E(ASIC will not investigate a complaint where:  )/K[19]/P 129 0 R/Pg 24 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj870 0 obj<</K[1652 0 R 1653 0 R 1654 0 R 1655 0 R 1656 0 R 1657 0 R 1658 0 R 1659 0 R]/P 129 0 R/Pg 24 0 R/S/L/Type/StructElem>>endobj462 0 obj<</E(*Students should be encouraged to look carefully \(and institutions should be particularly mindful to provide clarity where language barriers/cultural differences exist\) at the refund policy and complaints procedures before signing an acceptance offer to\ avoid any future misunderstanding. )/K[28]/P 129 0 R/Pg 24 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj447 0 obj<</E(4.2.1. ASIC and Institution action: )/K[13]/P 129 0 R/Pg 24 0 R/S/H3/T(4.2.1. ASIC and Institution action: )/Type/StructElem>>endobj871 0 obj<</K[1660 0 R 1661 0 R 1662 0 R]/P 129 0 R/Pg 24 0 R/S/L/Type/StructElem>>endobj451 0 obj<</E(4.2.2. Outcome: ASIC informs the complainant of the outcome and any recommendations made to the institution or will decide to investigate further; an inspector will then make an unannounced visit to assess the situation more thoroughly. In appropriate cas\es, ASIC will inform UKVI of genuine complaints and the result of any investigation.)/K[17]/P 129 0 R/Pg 24 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj1660 0 obj<</K[1000 0 R]/P 871 0 R/S/LI/Type/StructElem>>endobj1661 0 obj<</K[1001 0 R]/P 871 0 R/S/LI/Type/StructElem>>endobj1662 0 obj<</K[1002 0 R]/P 871 0 R/S/LI/Type/StructElem>>endobj1002 0 obj<</K 450 0 R/P 1662 0 R/S/LBody/Type/StructElem>>endobj450 0 obj<</E(ASIC contacts the principal/owner \(the institution must cooperate with the attempted resolution of any complaint upheld by ASIC, see Section 3.2.1.\) to investigate the complaint, who must then respond with the outcome of their investigation within ten w\orking days. The response \(by correspondence and, if necessary, a meeting between the principal/owner and the complainant\) must detail the complaint and propose a resolution. ASIC will review the response to ensure the institution is adhering to its acc\reditation commitments.)/K[16]/P 1002 0 R/Pg 24 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj1001 0 obj<</K 449 0 R/P 1661 0 R/S/LBody/Type/StructElem>>endobj449 0 obj<</E(ASIC reviews the evidence submitted. The complainant may need to provide further evidence as required.)/K[15]/P 1001 0 R/Pg 24 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj1000 0 obj<</K 448 0 R/P 1660 0 R/S/LBody/Type/StructElem>>endobj448 0 obj<</E(The ASIC Office officially logs the complaint, and its receipt is acknowledged.)/K[14]/P 1000 0 R/Pg 24 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj1652 0 obj<</K[1003 0 R]/P 870 0 R/S/LI/Type/StructElem>>endobj1653 0 obj<</K[1004 0 R]/P 870 0 R/S/LI/Type/StructElem>>endobj1654 0 obj<</K[1005 0 R]/P 870 0 R/S/LI/Type/StructElem>>endobj1655 0 obj<</K[1006 0 R]/P 870 0 R/S/LI/Type/StructElem>>endobj1656 0 obj<</K[1007 0 R]/P 870 0 R/S/LI/Type/StructElem>>endobj1657 0 obj<</K[1008 0 R]/P 870 0 R/S/LI/Type/StructElem>>endobj1658 0 obj<</K[1009 0 R]/P 870 0 R/S/LI/Type/StructElem>>endobj1659 0 obj<</K[1010 0 R]/P 870 0 R/S/LI/Type/StructElem>>endobj1010 0 obj<</K 461 0 R/P 1659 0 R/S/LBody/Type/StructElem>>endobj461 0 obj<</E(There is a contract dispute between the institution and its employee\(s\).  )/K[27]/P 1010 0 R/Pg 24 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj1009 0 obj<</K 460 0 R/P 1658 0 R/S/LBody/Type/StructElem>>endobj460 0 obj<</E(The complainant did not ensure that the course met their needs/check the awarding body has appropriate recognition for their requirements before* enrollment.)/K[26]/P 1009 0 R/Pg 24 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj1008 0 obj<</K 459 0 R/P 1657 0 R/S/LBody/Type/StructElem>>endobj459 0 obj<</E(A contractual agreement exists that negates the institutions refund procedures.)/K[25]/P 1008 0 R/Pg 24 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj1007 0 obj<</K 458 0 R/P 1656 0 R/S/LBody/Type/StructElem>>endobj458 0 obj<</E(The com