on Overview: Stage 2 focuses on statutory and immigration requirements, premises and health and safety, management, adequacy of teaching resources for the advertised/planned courses, and staff and student records.)/Type/StructElem>>endobj307 0 obj<</E(During the visit, the Inspector\(s\) will meet with the Owner\(s\)* to discuss the institution's Business Plan for ongoing operation and development; the Inspector will also discuss the format and arrangements for the Stage 3 visit.)/K[11]/P 121 0 R/Pg 16 0 R/S/H2/T(During the visit, the Inspector\(s\) will meet with the Owner\(s\)* to discuss the institution's Business Plan for ongoing operation and development; the Inspector will also discuss the format and arrangements for the Stage 3 visit.)/Type/StructElem>>endobj308 0 obj<</E(Inspection Format: The inspection will, usually \(as a minimum\), be a full-day visit** by one ASIC Inspector. After the Stage 2 visit, the Inspector will compile their report and submit it to the AAC. )/K[12]/P 121 0 R/Pg 16 0 R/S/H2/T(Inspection Format: The inspection will, usually \(as a minimum\), be a full-day visit** by one ASIC Inspector. After the Stage 2 visit, the Inspector will compile their report and submit it to the AAC. )/Type/StructElem>>endobj309 0 obj<</E(Summary of Inspector activities at Stage 2: )/K[13]/P 121 0 R/Pg 16 0 R/S/H1/T(Summary of Inspector activities at Stage 2: )/Type/StructElem>>endobj858 0 obj<</K[1595 0 R 1596 0 R 1597 0 R 1598 0 R 1599 0 R 1600 0 R 1601 0 R 1602 0 R 1603 0 R]/P 121 0 R/Pg 16 0 R/S/L/Type/StructElem>>endobj319 0 obj<</E(Decision: The ACC will consider the evidence and determine one of the following outcomes: )/K[23]/P 121 0 R/Pg 16 0 R/S/H2/T(Decision: The ACC will consider the evidence and determine one of the following outcomes: )/Type/StructElem>>endobj859 0 obj<</K[1604 0 R 1605 0 R 1606 0 R]/P 121 0 R/Pg 16 0 R/S/L/Type/StructElem>>endobj324 0 obj<</A[942 0 R 0]/K[28]/P 121 0 R/Pg 16 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>